{
  "summary": "Mozilla Thunderbird allows users to organise emails by adding custom folders, searching messages with advanced filters, and automating message management through filter rules. In Thunderbird, users can create a new folder, such as \"important mails,\" by right-clicking on an account and selecting the new folder option, allowing emails to be dragged and dropped directly from the inbox. The search messages tool under advanced features enables finding specific messages based on conditions like matching subject text, with options to save search results into a folder. Furthermore, message filters can be established to automatically sort incoming mail; for instance, rules can be defined to detect specific subject keywords and automatically move matching emails to a target folder when run. Thunderbird also supports managing multiple email accounts from providers like Gmail and Yahoo. While Gmail accounts can be configured automatically, accounts such as Yahoo require manual setup after enabling POP access within the account settings.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "fact": "The demonstration uses Ubuntu 12.04 and Mozilla Thunderbird 13.01.",
      "evidence": "यहाँ हम उबंटू 1204 पर मोज़िला थंडरबर्ड 1301 इस्तेमाल कर रहे हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "A new folder can be initiated by right-clicking an email account and choosing the new folder option.",
      "evidence": "stuserone at gmail dot com पर दायाँ क्लिक करें और new folder चुनें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Emails can be moved from the inbox to the important mails folder via drag and drop.",
      "evidence": "इस मेल को चुनकर इनबॉक्स से important mails फोल्डर में ड्रैग और ड्रॉप करते हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Clicking search messages under advanced features launches the message search interface.",
      "evidence": "दाएँ पैनल में advanced features के नीचे search messages पर क्लिक करें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Search criteria can be set to query messages matching a particular subject term such as ten interesting.",
      "evidence": "अगले फील्ड में ten interesting टाइप करें search पर क्लिक करें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "A filter is a rule applied to organise and sort messages within a mailbox.",
      "evidence": "फिल्टर एक नियम है जिसे आप अपने मेल बॉक्स के मैसेजेस को क्रमबद्ध करने के लिए लागू कर सकते हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Selecting manage message filters in advanced features displays the message filters dialog box.",
      "evidence": "advanced features में manage message filters पर क्लिक करें message filters डायलॉग बॉक्स प्रदर्शित होता है"
    },
    {
      "fact": "A filter action can be configured to move matching messages to a selected folder.",
      "evidence": "फिर perform these actions field में ऑप्शन को move message to में बदलें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Clicking run now applies the newly created filter immediately to the mailbox.",
      "evidence": "message filters डायलॉग बॉक्स में फिल्टर प्रदर्शित होता है run now पर क्लिक करें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Thunderbird configures Gmail accounts automatically, but other email accounts must be configured manually.",
      "evidence": "जीमेल अकाउंट्स थंडरबर्ड के द्वारा स्वतः ही कन्फिगर हो जाते हैं दूसरे अकाउंट्स को खुद से कन्फिगर करना होगा"
    },
    {
      "fact": "POP functionality must be enabled inside the Yahoo account before configuring it in Thunderbird.",
      "evidence": "मैंने याहू अकाउंट में pop को पहले से ही सक्षम किया है"
    }
  ]
}
